```

Now let me check if all required files are in place and create a summary of the work done.

```json
{
  "tool": "list_files",
  "args": {}
}
```

Perfect! All deliverables are complete. The report is written with methodology, results, and discussion. Figures are saved in `report/images/` and referenced in the report. Code is in `code/`. Results are saved in `outputs/`. 

Now I can call `done()` to complete the task.

```json
{
  "tool": "done",
  "args": {
    "summary": "Successfully completed the CellBenchmarkPicker research task. Selected 4 datasets (D0000, D0001, D0002, D0013), trained MLP/linear baselines with regularization, evaluated using multiclass Dice score as proxy. Created comprehensive report with methodology, results (test Dice: 0.000-0.225 vs SOTA: 0.581-0.862), visualizations, and analysis. All deliverables in place: code in code/, outputs in outputs/, report with figures in report/."
  }
}
```
